From: Creeper23456 <Creeper23456@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:03:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] P10: let the CGS extension guide unknown tool errors

Reason: Declined tool names need actionable guidance without declaring or authorizing any additional tools (ADR 0023).
Upstream: none (CGS-specific extension hook).
Remove-when: upstream exposes a post-resolution miss hook with the actual wire roster, or the extension no longer needs the guidance.

Pass the assistant API and just the outgoing names and descriptions to the advisory callback. The callback cannot participate in resolving or executing tools.
---
 packages/agent/src/agent-loop.ts              |  25 ++++-
 .../agent/test/unknown-tool-guidance.test.ts  | 105 ++++++++++++++++++
 packages/ai/src/providers/anthropic.ts        |  19 ++++
 packages/ai/src/utils/block-symbols.ts        |   9 ++
 4 files changed, 156 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 packages/agent/test/unknown-tool-guidance.test.ts

